---
import { homeFaqs, productInfo, siteConfig } from '../data/site';

const shareUrl = encodeURIComponent(siteConfig.url + '/');
const shareText = encodeURIComponent('Enlisted Cheats — undetected ESP & aimbot for PC');

const packageIncludes = [
	...productInfo.features.esp.slice(0, 3),
	...productInfo.features.aimbot.slice(0, 2),
	...productInfo.features.general.slice(0, 2),
];
---

<section class="home-seo shell" aria-labelledby="home-seo-title">
	<div class="home-seo__panel card-surface">
		<h2 id="home-seo-title">Enlisted Cheats for Windows PC</h2>
		<p>
			Enlisted Cheats is a Windows PC cheats and hacks package for Enlisted. It includes ESP, aimbot, and wallhack for
			campaign missions, squad assaults, and large-scale battles.
		</p>
		<p>
			We update the package after Enlisted and anti-cheat patches. We do not claim it stays
			undetected forever — check status here before you play.
		</p>
		<p>This page helps you:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Compare <a href="/enlisted-esp/">ESP</a>, <a href="/enlisted-aimbot/">aimbot</a>, and <a href="/enlisted-wallhack/">wallhack</a></li>
			<li>See <a href="/pricing/">monthly ($35) and lifetime ($150) pricing</a></li>
			<li>Check if the latest build is live after an anti-cheat patch</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			Start with the <a href="/enlisted-cheats/">Enlisted Cheats guide</a>, then open
			<a href="/enlisted-esp/">ESP</a>, <a href="/enlisted-aimbot/">Aimbot</a>,
			<a href="/features/">Features</a>, and <a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a>.
			Game updates come from
			<a href="https://enlisted.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Enlisted</a>.
			Anti-cheat updates come from
			<a href="https://www.digitalextremes.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gaijin</a>.
			Always read our <a href="/updates/">Updates log</a> before you load into a match.
		</p>

		<div class="home-seo__grid">
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/enlisted-cheats/">Enlisted Cheats guide</a></h3>
				<p>What the package includes: ESP, aimbot, wallhack, and how updates work after patches.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/enlisted-esp/">Enlisted ESP</a></h3>
				<p>See enemy units, enemy vehicles, and tanks and artillery through cover, with distance on screen.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/enlisted-aimbot/">Enlisted Aimbot</a></h3>
				<p>Aim assist with smoothness, FOV, and hotkeys for mouse and controller.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/enlisted-wallhack/">Enlisted wallhack</a></h3>
				<p>Wallhack overlays that show enemies through terrain when ESP is on.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/enlisted-cheats/">Undetected status</a></h3>
				<p>What “undetected” means here, and where to check status after an anti-cheat patch.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a></h3>
				<p>Monthly $35 or lifetime $150. Digital delivery after you pay.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/setup/">Setup</a></h3>
				<p>How to activate the license and turn on ESP and aimbot for the first time.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a></h3>
				<p>Common questions on delivery, updates, Windows PC support, and billing help.</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="home-seo__panel card-surface">
		<h2>What the package includes</h2>
		<p>
			For Enlisted on Windows PC. ESP, aimbot, and radar in one license. Monthly or lifetime plans.
			Updates after anti-cheat patches. Support included.
		</p>
		<ul>
			{packageIncludes.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
		</ul>
		<p>
			Compare monthly and lifetime plans on <a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a>. After a game patch, check
			<a href="/updates/">Updates</a> before you play. Refund, privacy, and terms links are in the footer.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="home-seo__panel card-surface">
		<h2>How to choose before you buy</h2>
		<ul class="home-seo__choose">
			<li>
				<span class="home-seo__choose-q">See enemies first?</span>
				<span class="home-seo__choose-a">Read the <a href="/enlisted-esp/">ESP page</a></span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="home-seo__choose-q">Need help aiming?</span>
				<span class="home-seo__choose-a">Read the <a href="/enlisted-aimbot/">Aimbot page</a></span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="home-seo__choose-q">Ready to buy?</span>
				<span class="home-seo__choose-a">
					Check both pages, then pick <a href="/pricing/">monthly ($35)</a> or
					<a href="/pricing/">lifetime ($150)</a> on Pricing
				</span>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="home-seo__choose-note">
			Works on {productInfo.platforms.join(' and ')}. Available {siteConfig.market}.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="home-seo__panel card-surface">
		<h2 id="faq-heading">FAQ</h2>
		<div class="home-seo__faq">
			{homeFaqs.map((item) => (
				<details>
					<summary>{item.question}</summary>
					<p set:html={item.answer} />
				</details>
			))}
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="home-seo__share" aria-label="Share">
		<a
			href={`https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=${shareUrl}&text=${shareText}`}
			rel="noopener noreferrer"
			target="_blank"
		>
			Share
		</a>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.home-seo {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		padding-block: var(--section-space);
	}

	.home-seo__panel {
		padding: 1.35rem 1.4rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
	}

	.home-seo__panel h2 {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);
		font-weight: 750;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.home-seo__panel p,
	.home-seo__panel li {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.65;
		font-size: 0.98rem;
	}

	.home-seo__panel ul {
		margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		list-style: disc;
	}

	.home-seo__choose {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.55rem;
	}

	.home-seo__choose li {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.15rem;
		padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
		border-radius: 0.7rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(32, 191, 192, 0.14);
		background: rgba(13, 35, 36, 0.55);
	}

	.home-seo__choose-q {
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-ink);
	}

	.home-seo__choose-a {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.home-seo__choose-note {
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
		padding-top: 0.75rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(32, 191, 192, 0.12);
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		color: var(--color-faint);
	}

	.home-seo__panel a {
		color: var(--color-orchid);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
	}

	.home-seo__grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.85rem;
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
	}

	.home-seo__grid article {
		padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 0.55rem;
		background: rgba(20, 24, 28, 0.55);
	}

	.home-seo__grid h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.home-seo__grid p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.home-seo__faq details {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		padding: 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.home-seo__faq summary {
		cursor: pointer;
		font-weight: 650;
		color: var(--color-ink);
	}

	.home-seo__faq p {
		margin: 0.55rem 0 0;
	}

	.home-seo__share {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
	}

	.home-seo__share a {
		color: var(--color-faint);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}
</style>
